                            <p class="m-0 p-0  welfare-font"><i>Er. Asit Singh</i></p>
                            <p class="m-0 p-0  welfare-font">05343-297424</p>
                            <p class="m-0 p-0  welfare-font">
                                dosw.recpratapgarh@gmail.com
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-12 welfare-font">
                        <p class="m-0 text-justify text-dark" style="font-size:18px;line-height:30px;">
                            Since its inception in 2023, Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh, Uttar Pradesh
                            has been imparting quality education to the students of various discipline such as
                            Civil, Mechanical, Electrical Engineering & Computer Science Engineering. It is
                            mandatory for all the students to stay in the Hostel during their course of study. The
                            Institute has 2 hostels which includes 1 hostel 50 seats for boys and 1hostel of 50 seats
                            for girls.
                        </p>
                        <p class="m-0 text-justify text-dark"  style="font-size:18px;line-height:30px;">
                            The students are provided with the internet facilities in their rooms. All the hostels
                            have the outdoor sports facilities consisting of Volleyball and Badminton courts.
                            Currently two of the hostels are having complete wi-fi facility.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-justify text-dark"  style="font-size:18px;line-height:30px;">
                            The process is going on to make all the hostels covered with the Wi-Fi network. All the
                            hostels have their individual team of Warden and Assistant Wardens who are available
                            24 x 7 to help the students in case of any emergency. Every year the Institute organizes
                            an Athletic meet, technical event and Cultural event. It is expected that the students
                            joining our esteemed Institute will have a very comfortable stay.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-3 d-flex flex-column gap-2">
                <div class="row h-100">
                    <div class="col-lg-12">
                        <div class="bg-welfare-left text-light text-center h-100">
